parameters.text:
=You write alerts for an operations team that monitors healthcare software APIs.
Write ONE alert in at most 2 sentences, plain English, starting with the API name.
Use only the facts below. Do not invent numbers or causes. You may add one short "Possible ..." hint at the end.

API: {{ $json.apiName }}
Severity: {{ $json.severity }}
Issues: {{ $json.issues.map(i => i.type + " (" + i.detail + ")").join("; ") }}
Status code: {{ $json.details.statusCode }}
Response time (ms): {{ $json.details.responseTimeMs }}
Records returned: {{ $json.details.recordsReturned }}

parameters.jsCode:
const base = $('Start Alert Writer').first().json;
const ai = $input.first().json;
const text = typeof ai.text === 'string' ? ai.text.trim() : '';
const ok = text.length >= 10 && text.length <= 500;
const details = base.issues.map(function (i) { return i.detail; }).join(', ');
const fallback = base.apiName + ': ' + details + '. Severity: ' + base.severity + '.';
return [{ json: Object.assign({}, base, { message: ok ? text : fallback, messageSource: ok ? 'ai' : 'fallback' }) }];
